{"format_version":"0.1","record_type":"person_source_bundle","requested_person_id":"f7y_qvp_mch_B","canonical_person_id":"f7y_qvp_mch_B","id_aliases":[],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","person_ids":["f7y_qvp_mch_B"],"persons":[{"id":"c2w_s7g_en0_A","label":"子蘭（楚懷王子）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"子蘭","mention_ids":["c-shiji-040-chu:m078-0320","c-shiji-084-qujia:m007-0044","c-shiji-084-qujia:m008-0010","c-shiji-084-qujia:m008-0020"]},{"surface":"令尹子蘭","mention_ids":["c-shiji-084-qujia:m009-0178","c-shiji-084-qujia:m010-0000"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:m078-0320","chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p078","quote":"子蘭"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-084-qujia:m007-0044","chapter_id":"c-shiji-084-qujia","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-084-qujia:p007","quote":"子蘭"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-084-qujia:m008-0010","chapter_id":"c-shiji-084-qujia","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-084-qujia:p008","quote":"子蘭"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-084-qujia:m008-0020","chapter_id":"c-shiji-084-qujia","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-084-qujia:p008","quote":"子蘭"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-084-qujia:m009-0178","chapter_id":"c-shiji-084-qujia","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-084-qujia:p009","quote":"令尹子蘭"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-084-qujia:m010-0000","chapter_id":"c-shiji-084-qujia","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-084-qujia:p010","quote":"令尹子蘭"}],"family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-040-chu","source_id":"s-shiji-040-chu","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-040-chu:p078","quote":"二十七年，秦大夫有私與楚太子鬬，楚太子殺之而亡歸。二十八年，秦乃與齊、韓、魏共攻楚，殺楚將唐眛，取我重丘而去。二十九年，秦復攻楚，大破楚，楚軍死者二萬，殺我將軍景缺。懷王恐，乃使太子爲質於齊以求平。三十年，秦復伐楚，取八城。秦昭王遺楚王書曰：「始寡人與王約爲弟兄，盟于黃棘，太子爲質，至驩也。太子陵殺寡人之重臣，不謝而亡去，寡人誠不勝怒，使兵侵君王之邊。今聞君王乃令太子質於齊以求平。寡人與楚接境壤界，故爲婚姻，所從相親久矣。而今秦楚不驩，則無以令諸侯。寡人願與君王會武關，面相約，結盟而去，寡人之願也。敢以聞下執事。」楚懷王見秦王書，患之。欲往，恐見欺；無往，恐秦怒。昭雎曰：「王毋行，而發兵自守耳。秦虎狼，不可信，有并諸侯之心。」懷王子子蘭勸王行，曰：「柰何絶秦之驩心！」於是往會秦昭王。昭王詐令一將軍伏兵武關，號爲秦王。楚王至，則閉武關，遂與西至咸陽，朝章臺，如蕃臣，不與亢禮。楚懷王大怒，悔不用昭子言。秦因留楚王，要以割巫、黔中之郡。楚王欲盟，秦欲先得地。楚王怒曰：「秦詐我而又彊要我以地！」不復許秦。秦因留之。","source_term":"懷王","term_role":"literal_person_anchor_in_relation_context","interpretation_note":"原關係主張的source_term是合述描述；此欄保留本段實際人物錨點。關係及完整證據見source_assertion_id。"}],"source_assertion_id":"a-shiji040-079","interpretation_note":"以此受傳正文的明示近親主張配置局部家族；不合併跨篇候選身份、不補闕名世代，不表示遠祖世系已核實。分支字元不是長幼排行。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","parent_person_id":"c2w_s7g_en0"}},{"id":"f7y_qvp_mch","label":"楚懷王（屈原賈生列傳候選）","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"楚懷王","mention_ids":["c-shiji-084-qujia:m001-0014","c-shiji-084-qujia:m004-0071"]},{"surface":"懷王","mention_ids":["c-shiji-084-qujia:m002-0017","c-shiji-084-qujia:m004-0119","c-shiji-084-qujia:m004-0122","c-shiji-084-qujia:m004-0166","c-shiji-084-qujia:m005-0076","c-shiji-084-qujia:m005-0084","c-shiji-084-qujia:m005-0117","c-shiji-084-qujia:m005-0129","c-shiji-084-qujia:m007-0010","c-shiji-084-qujia:m007-0014","c-shiji-084-qujia:m007-0040","c-shiji-084-qujia:m007-0058","c-shiji-084-qujia:m007-0076","c-shiji-084-qujia:m007-0084","c-shiji-084-qujia:m008-0024","c-shiji-084-qujia:m009-0017","c-shiji-084-qujia:m009-0075","c-shiji-084-qujia:m009-0145"]}],"evidence":[{"mention_id":"c-shiji-084-qujia:m001-0014","chapter_id":"c-shiji-084-qujia","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-084-qujia:p001","quote":"楚懷王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-084-qujia:m002-0017","chapter_id":"c-shiji-084-qujia","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-084-qujia:p002","quote":"懷王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-084-qujia:m004-0071","chapter_id":"c-shiji-084-qujia","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-084-qujia:p004","quote":"楚懷王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-084-qujia:m004-0119","chapter_id":"c-shiji-084-qujia","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-084-qujia:p004","quote":"懷王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-084-qujia:m004-0122","chapter_id":"c-shiji-084-qujia","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-084-qujia:p004","quote":"懷王"},{"mention_id":"c-shiji-084-qujia:m004-0166","chapter_id":"c-shiji-084-qujia","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-084-qujia:p0